# Port patch, wish of the project owner (07.11.2026, GitHub issue #161): the cheat "Random items" of the app's cheat
# menu deals the items lying in the story's rooms anew (runtime/cheats.cpp re4_item_random). The game sets an item
# area up in sceAtSetItem; its first call in a room comes after the room's item models (the ITM block) are loaded
# and before any of its item areas made a model, so the hook here sees the room's ITA records once, untouched, and
# changes what it may there (item id and count of records lying free in the room: no enemy, barrel or box holds
# them, no flag of the game's own random drops, no key, file, weapon or part). Only to an item whose model the
# room has. With the cheat off nothing changes; the next room is read from the disc again.
--- a/src/game/sce_at.cpp
